      "data": {
        "text": "**Initiating Client Setup**\n\nI've just finished creating `translation_models.py`. The next step is to get the AWS Translate client up and running. Therefore, I'm now moving on to building `translation_client.py` to establish that client.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789828610101,
