        "text": "**Implementing Batch Translation**\n\nI'm now focusing on `batch_translate.py`. My plan is to leverage Google Cloud Translation instead of AWS for this implementation. I need to establish a client and then employ it to perform the translation of a list of input strings.\n\n\n**Defining Cloud Translation Client**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Translation for batch processing in `batch_translate.py`. My primary objective now is setting up the translation client correctly to interface with the Google Cloud Translation service. I'm focusing on how to translate the strings in this context.\n\n\n",
